   {
    "chain_alternation": 6,
    "chain_mismatch": 0,
    "chain_pointer": 6,
    "grade": "good",
    "messages": [
     {
      "body": "（把一袋新米往阿禾手里塞）拿着，自家田里的，不图啥，就图个踏实。",
      "channel": "dm",
      "day": 0,
      "from": "P001",
      "hearer": "阿禾",
      "msg_uid": "42:629",
      "place": "market",
      "reply_to": null,
      "round": 6,
      "seq": 629,
      "slot": "evening",
      "speaker": "老周",
      "tags": [
       "gift"
      ],
      "to": "P003"
     },
     {
      "body": "（推了推袋子）老周，这……你家也不宽裕，我拿回去心里不踏实。",
      "channel": "dm",
      "day": 0,
      "from": "P003",
      "hearer": "老周",
      "msg_uid": "42:794",
      "place": "plaza",
      "reply_to": "42:629",
      "round": 7,
      "seq": 794,
      "slot": "evening",
      "speaker": "阿禾",
      "tags": [
       "gift"
      ],
      "to": "P001"
     },
     {
      "body": "（把袋子又推回去）拿着吧，自家地里长的，不值钱。",
      "channel": "dm",
      "day": 0,
      "from": "P001",
      "hearer": "阿禾",
      "msg_uid": "42:929",
      "place": "residence",
      "reply_to": "42:794",
      "round": 9,
      "seq": 929,
      "slot": "night",
      "speaker": "老周",
      "tags": [
       "gift"
      ],
      "to": "P003"
     },
     {
      "body": "（搓了搓手）那……我收下了。回头给你送点新磨的玉米面。",
      "channel": "dm",
      "day": 0,
      "from": "P003",
      "hearer": "老周",
      "msg_uid": "42:1393",
      "place": "residence",
      "reply_to": "42:929",
      "round": 10,
      "seq": 1393,
      "slot": "night",
      "speaker": "阿禾",
      "tags": [
       "gift"
      ],
      "to": "P001"
     },
     {
      "body": "（摆摆手）不用不用，自家地里长的，不值几个钱。",
      "channel": "dm",
      "day": 1,
      "from": "P001",
      "hearer": "阿禾",
      "msg_uid": "42:1695",
      "place": "park",
      "reply_to": "42:1393",
      "round": 12,
      "seq": 1695,
      "slot": "morning",
      "speaker": "老周",
      "tags": [
       "gift"
      ],
      "to": "P003"
     },
     {
      "body": "（搓了搓手）那……我就收下了。你听说没，镇上来了外乡人，也不知道是干啥的。",
      "channel": "dm",
      "day": 1,
      "from": "P003",
      "hearer": "老周",
      "msg_uid": "42:1897",
      "place": "farm",
      "reply_to": "42:1695",
      "round": 13,
      "seq": 1897,
      "slot": "morning",
      "speaker": "阿禾",
      "tags": [
       "gift"
      ],
      "to": "P001"
     }
    ],
