     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（喘气）老周，稳是稳，可这练法我肚子饿得慌，先歇会儿吧。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:3362",
     "place": "farm",
     "reply_to": "42:3192",
     "round": 27,
     "seq": 3362,
     "slot": "afternoon",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "combat_training"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    },
    {
     "body": "（抹了把汗）歇不得，天快黑了。再练一趟，回去我给你煮碗面。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:3458",
     "place": "market",
     "reply_to": "42:3362",
     "round": 28,
     "seq": 3458,
     "slot": "afternoon",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "combat_training"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（喘着气）行，再练一趟。不过老周，你那面得多下点，我今儿饿得慌。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:3559",
     "place": "cafe",
     "reply_to": "42:3458",
     "round": 30,
     "seq": 3559,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "combat_training"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    },
    {
     "body": "（抹了把汗）面我揉好了，搁灶上醒着呢。练完这趟就下锅。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:3689",
     "place": "cafe",
     "reply_to": "42:3559",
     "round": 31,
     "seq": 3689,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "combat_training"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（点头）嗯，练完再吃。老周，这趟练完，我想跟你商量个事。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:4233",
     "place": "residence",
     "reply_to": "42:3689",
     "round": 33,
     "seq": 4233,
     "slot": "night",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "combat_training"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    }
   ],
   "n_msgs": 6,
   "peer_named_msgs": 4,
   "ptr_msgs": 5,
   "signals": 3,
   "thread_key": "T:TH-P001-P003-25",
   "turns_A": 6
  },
  {
   "chain_alternation": 6,
   "chain_mismatch": 0,
   "chain_pointer": 6,
   "grade": "good",
   "messages": [
    {
     "body": "（把一袋新米往阿禾手里塞）拿着，自家田里的，不图啥，就图个踏实。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:629",
     "place": "market",
     "reply_to": null,
     "round": 6,
     "seq": 629,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（推了推袋子）老周，这……你家也不宽裕，我拿回去心里不踏实。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:794",
     "place": "plaza",
     "reply_to": "42:629",
     "round": 7,
     "seq": 794,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    },
    {
     "body": "（把袋子又推回去）拿着吧，自家地里长的，不值钱。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:929",
     "place": "residence",
     "reply_to": "42:794",
     "round": 9,
     "seq": 929,
     "slot": "night",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（搓了搓手）那……我收下了。回头给你送点新磨的玉米面。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:1393",
     "place": "residence",
     "reply_to": "42:929",
     "round": 10,
     "seq": 1393,
     "slot": "night",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    },
    {
     "body": "（摆摆手）不用不用，自家地里长的，不值几个钱。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 1,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:1695",
     "place": "park",
     "reply_to": "42:1393",
     "round": 12,
     "seq": 1695,
     "slot": "morning",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（搓了搓手）那……我就收下了。你听说没，镇上来了外乡人，也不知道是干啥的。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 1,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:1897",
     "place": "farm",
     "reply_to": "42:1695",
     "round": 13,
     "seq": 1897,
     "slot": "morning",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    }
   ],
   "n_msgs": 6,
   "peer_named_msgs": 2,
   "ptr_msgs": 5,
   "signals": 3,
   "thread_key": "T:TH-P001-P003-6",
   "turns_A": 6
  },
  {
   "chain_alternation": 6,
   "chain_mismatch": 0,
   "chain_pointer": 6,
   "grade": "good",
   "messages": [
    {
     "body": "（低头刨木，没看你）秀娘，这块料……你摸摸，顺不顺。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P002",
     "hearer": "秀娘",
     "msg_uid": "42:3554",
     "place": "cafe",
     "reply_to": null,
     "round": 30,
     "seq": 3554,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "老石",
     "tags": [
      "whisper"
     ],
     "to": "P004"
    },
    {
     "body": "（伸手摸了摸木料，指尖顺着纹路走）哎哟，是顺，跟刚出炉的馒头似的，摸着就舒坦。老石，你这手艺……（顿了顿，压低声音）我这两天心里头也跟这木头似的，看着平，其实里头拧着劲儿。镇上这气氛，你觉出来没有？",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P004",
     "hearer": "老石",
     "msg_uid": "42:3840",
     "place": "cafe",
     "reply_to": "42:3554",
     "round": 31,
     "seq": 3840,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "秀娘",
     "tags": [
      "whisper"
     ],
     "to": "P002"
    },
    {
     "body": "（没抬头，用刨子又走了一道）嗯。木头拧着，得顺着纹来。人拧着，不好说。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P002",
     "hearer": "秀娘",
     "msg_uid": "42:4101",
     "place": "residence",
     "reply_to": "42:3840",
     "round": 33,
     "seq": 4101,
     "slot": "night",
     "speaker": "老石",
     "tags": [
      "whisper"
     ],
     "to": "P004"
    },
    {
     "body": "（把围裙角在手指上绕了一圈，又松开）你说得对，人比木头难顺。我这两天心里就拧着——夜里翻来覆去，老想着铺子里那点事，越想越睡不着。老石，你说，人要是心里搁着话，是不是也得像你这刨子一样，走一道，才顺得下来？",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 2,
     "from": "P004",
     "hearer": "老石",
     "msg_uid": "42:4747",
     "place": "residence",
     "reply_to": "42:4101",
     "round": 34,
     "seq": 4747,
     "slot": "night",
     "speaker": "秀娘",
     "tags": [
      "whisper"
     ],
     "to": "P002"
    },
    {
     "body": "（用拇指蹭了蹭刨刃）话搁着，会发霉。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 3,
     "from": "P002",
     "hearer": "秀娘",
     "msg_uid": "42:4933",
     "place": "workshop",
     "reply_to": "42:4747",
     "round": 36,
     "seq": 4933,
     "slot": "morning",
     "speaker": "老石",
     "tags": [
      "whisper"
     ],
     "to": "P004"
    },
    {
     "body": "（把围裙往腰后一系，凑近半步）哎，老石，你这话我听着心里发紧。那个外乡人，昨儿在我铺子门口站了半晌，也不进来，就盯着橱窗里那盘新烤的桂花卷看。我端了杯热茶出去，他倒走了。你说……他是不是有啥难处？",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 3,
     "from": "P004",
     "hearer": "老石",
     "msg_uid": "42:5129",
     "place": "farm",
     "reply_to": "42:4933",
     "round": 37,
     "seq": 5129,
     "slot": "morning",
     "speaker": "秀娘",
     "tags": [
      "whisper"
     ],
     "to": "P002"
    }
   ],
